          "innerHTML": "<div style='font-family:\"Inter\",sans-serif; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><h4 style='color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; margin:0; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:1px;'>Senior Designer</h4><p style='color:#ff2d78; font-size:10px; margin:5px 0 10px 0; letter-spacing:2px;'>ATELIER BLANC &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2015 — 2020</p><p style='color:#aaaaaa; font-size:11px; font-weight:300; line-height:1.6;'>Specialised in sculptural evening wear. Managed fabric sourcing across Italy and Japan. Three Vogue Italia cover features.</p></div>",
